           AND `Art 14(5)(c) paragraphs 1 to 4 do not apply where and insofar as obtaining or disclosure is expressly laid down by Union or Member State law` EQUALS JUST FALSE
           AND `Art 14(5)(d) paragraphs 1 to 4 do not apply where the personal data must remain confidential subject to an obligation of professional secrecy` EQUALS JUST FALSE
